{"id":377130,"bangumiId":377130,"type":2,"name":"とんがり帽子のアトリエ","name_cn":"尖帽子的魔法工房","date":"2026-04-06","year":"2026","region":"jp","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/27/ff/377130_wDU1x.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/27/ff/377130_wDU1x.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/27/ff/377130_wDU1x.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/27/ff/377130_wDU1x.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/27/ff/377130_wDU1x.jpg"},"summary":"众人皆以为魔法是与生俱来的血统，可可却意外撞见了通往魔女之路的另一种可能，这也让她陷入左右世界命运的争斗核心。\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n[简介原文]\r\n生まれた時から魔法を使えない人は魔法使いになれないし、魔法をかける瞬間を見てはならないのがこの世界の掟。\r\nそれでも小さな村の少女・ココは、昔から魔法使いへの憧れを抱き続けていた。\r\nある日、村を訪れた魔法使い・キーフリーが魔法を使うところを見てしまい、大きな秘密を知る。\r\nそれは、特別な道具で魔法陣を描けば、本当は誰にでも魔法が使えるという、魔法使いたちが隠した「絶対の秘密」だった――。","rating":{"rank":6943,"total":4938,"count":{"1":17,"2":18,"3":64,"4":247,"5":691,"6":1880,"7":1516,"8":407,"9":60,"10":38},"score":6.2},"collection":{"on_hold":595,"dropped":1079,"wish":2597,"collect":6057,"doing":3871},"tags":[{"name":"奇幻","count":1320,"total_count":491527},{"name":"2026年4月","count":1218,"total_count":26365},{"name":"漫画改","count":1130,"total_count":891340},{"name":"TV","count":908,"total_count":1443522},{"name":"BUGFILMS","count":787,"total_count":1649},{"name":"魔法","count":785,"total_count":20546},{"name":"2026","count":567,"total_count":55092},{"name":"漫改","count":506,"total_count":369858},{"name":"日本","count":472,"total_count":313490},{"name":"渡边步","count":337,"total_count":1685},{"name":"战斗","count":288,"total_count":489014},{"name":"白浜鴎","count":162,"total_count":163},{"name":"渡辺歩","count":108,"total_count":1014},{"name":"2025","count":60,"total_count":74812},{"name":"2026年","count":52,"total_count":2254},{"name":"异世界","count":43,"total_count":273464}],"eps":13,"total_episodes":13,"aliases":["尖帽子的魔法工房","とんがり帽子のアトリエ","魔法帽的工作室","Atelier of Witch Hat","Witch Hat Atelier","Tongari Boushi no Atelier"],"sourceType":"bibliography","nsfw":false,"annualRank":21,"s